
## Data Model (ERD)

The solution uses **7 Dataverse tables**. All relationships are enforced at the data layer.

```
USER ──────────────────────┐
  │  (submits)             │ (assigned to)
  │ 1:N                    │ 1:N
  ▼                        ▼
TICKET ──── 1:1 ──── SLA_RECORD
  │
  ├── 1:N ──── TICKET_COMMENT
  ├── 1:N ──── ATTACHMENT
  ├── N:1 ──── CATEGORY
  └── N:1 ──── TEAM

USER ◄──── M:N ────► TEAM
